{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create Rooms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create rooms.Set up your own office. Expand your office as you wish. Transform from a small office to a large company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770890/extras/5.gif?t=1748555281\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Office Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have the option to furnish your office space. Choose from various furniture items to keep your team comfortable and productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770890/extras/4.gif?t=1748555281\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hiring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hire talented people. You will need staff for each department.You need to maintain balance in the office. You need to keep the happiness of the people you hire at a high level. You don\u2019t want to lose your talented employees to other companies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770890/extras/3.gif?t=1748555281\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your own game projects. Increase your followers. Rock the charts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770890/extras/2.gif?t=1748555281\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Employee Tracking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow those who try to escape from work with a camera and make them return to their work. Because you will have a specific schedule to finish the work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770890/extras/1.gif?t=1748555281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebac